Follow-up0002 extracts the JSON service transport to PVE::WebRTC in
pve-guest-common, shared with the LXC API. Apply shared-guest-common first.
The VM-specific safe shared-display check remains in QemuServer::WebRTC.
The service accepts old v2 VM requests without a kind for rolling upgrades.
